x = 0


# Start Loop
while x < 500 {
  clear
  color(0, 0, 255)
  circle(x, 200, 30)
  color(0, 0, 80)
  circle(x, 200, 25)
  color(255, 0, 0)
  circle(-(x), 200, 30)
  color(255, 100, 0)
  circle(-(x), 200, 20)
  # Update position
  x = x + 10
  
  # Wait for 50ms so eyes can see it
  sleep(100)
}

### Supported Shapes
1.  **`circle(x, y, radius)`**: Draws a filled circle.
2.  **`rect(x, y, width, height)`**: Draws a filled rectangle.
3.  **`line(x1, y1, x2, y2)`**: Draws a line between two points.

You can verify these commands at any time by running the command `help`.